+- Consumes: `Module`, `ImportFrom`, `FuncDef`, `Params`, `Return`, `ListComp`, `CompFor`, `Name`, `Compare`, and `CmpOp` terms.
+- Produces: `execute(Pgm, String, PyList, String)`, expression evaluation under a `Map`, and terminal `PyList` results.
