+```bash
+bash -n prove.sh
+./prove.sh
+```
+
+Expected: zero exit, correct `krun` results, and `#Top` from every positive proof command. If not, preserve diagnostics and explain the concrete remaining issue in `NOTES.md` without claiming success.
